{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaR1gQM2EtQ8UqzwRbf6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I proved `mySum_append` in `Main.lean`, and `lean Main.lean` now runs with no errors or warnings.\n\n```lean\ntheorem mySum_append (xs ys : List Nat) : mySum (xs ++ ys) = mySum xs + mySum ys := by\n  induction xs with\n  | nil => simp [mySum]\n  | cons x xs ih => simp [mySum, ih, Nat.add_assoc]\n```\n\nThe proof works by induction on `xs`:\n- **Empty list:** `mySum ([] ++ ys)` simplifies to `0 + mySum ys`, which equals `mySum ys`.\n- **List starting with `x`:** unfolding `mySum` turns the goal into `x + mySum (xs ++ ys) = (x + mySum xs) + mySum ys`. The induction hypothesis `ih` rewrites the left side, and `Nat.add_assoc` (associativity of addition) makes both sides match."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":433,"cache_read_input_tokens":7866,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":433},"output_tokens":318,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd86e2fa-c26c-4403-b8a1-02164fc2daa2","uuid":"0496374c-5322-4f0f-a4e7-fb8f948725bd","timestamp":"2026-10-31T13:44:25.040Z","request_id":"req_011CgaR1gATgd5KWDJ93fLoJ"}
